# No AI / wrong-account git attribution

When creating commits or pull requests in this repo:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any AI/agent trailer
- Do **not** ask to enable commit/PR attribution to the agent
- Do **not** use `mutual99` / `152463166+mutual99@...` (deleted account email)
- Author/committer must be `mutual534` / `299343060+DavidLee534@users.noreply.github.com`
- If a commit message template would include agent attribution, strip it before committing
